# ── results and trained networks: never in git ────────────────────────────────
# The previous repo grew to 13 GB because .eqx policies and result CSVs were
# committed; they live on scratch and in /archive, not here.
# Exceptions: artifacts/ (five compressed tarballs, ~141 MB, holding the frozen
# snapshot the paper used) and figs_audit/ (the final figures, ~2 MB).
results*/
results_floor*/
mm_warmstart*/
*.eqx
*.npz

# ── slurm: cluster wrappers and their logs, specific to the authors' machine ──
logs/
run_*.sh
slurm-*.out
slurm-*.err
*.sbatch

# ── internal notes, references, smoke test ──────────────────────────────────
AGENT_README.md
LITTERATURE/
smoke_rung3.py
results_smoke_r3/

# ── python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/

# ── local scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tmp
.DS_Store
